        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, building, door, inner, functional, wood, steel frame, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, building, door, inner, functional, wood, steel frame, to final disposal
The amount of materials to be disposed of at the end of life was estimated based on the bill of materials. A cut-off approach is used for recycling of metals (aluminium, steel frame).\nTechnology: Industry data.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Entsorgungssysteme\nLocal subcategory: Gebäudeentsorgung\nUVEK 2022 source file:634_EcoSpold_Türen_v1.5_UVEK2021_v0.1._X-Tür_Entsorgung.xml\n\n
UUID: bf02a3d6-fab4-4882-bb7a-02d464e5cb0d
Included processes are the disposal of wood, glue, steel, paint and silicone. The transport to the municipal incineration plant is included.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bf02a3d6-fab4-4882-bb7a-02d464e5cb0d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
